    <body>
      <div xml:id="gom-prov27">
        <head xml:id="gom-prov27-Hd1e98">Caput 27</head>
        <div xml:id="gom-prov27-Dd1e100">
          <head xml:id="gom-prov27-Hd1e102">Versus 1</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-prov27-d1e104">
            <quote xml:id="gom-prov27-Qd1e106" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/prov27_1@1-2">Ne glorieris.</quote>
            Ne securus sis aliquando de futuro; quia etsi hodie servis Domino qualis esse in <pb ed="#P" n="1110B"/> futurum possis, quomodo viam finire, prorsus videre non vales. <quote xml:id="gom-prov27-Qd1e111" source="http://scta.info/resource/prov28_14@1-6">Beatus homo qui semper est pavidus.</quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-prov27-Dd1e116">
          <head xml:id="gom-prov27-Hd1e118">Versus 3</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-prov27-d1e120">
            <quote xml:id="gom-prov27-Qd1e122" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/prov27_3@1-3">Grave est saxum.</quote>
            <quote xml:id="gom-prov27-Qd1e125"><seg type="qs">Grave est</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">ita mentis quoque motus examinant et castigant.</seg></quote>
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-prov27-d1e133">
            <quote xml:id="gom-prov27-Qd1e135" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/prov27_3@8-11">Ira stulti utroque gravior,</quote>
            etc. <quote xml:id="gom-prov27-Qd1e138"><seg type="qs">De quo supra</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">et furori frena laxat.</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-prov27-Dd1e147">
          <head xml:id="gom-prov27-Hd1e149">Versus 5</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-prov27-d1e151">
            <quote xml:id="gom-prov27-Qd1e153" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/prov27_5@1-4">Melior est manifesta correctio.</quote>
            <quote xml:id="gom-prov27-Qd1e156"><seg type="qs">Amor absconditus, illicitus</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">quam studio similiter peccandi clam diligere.</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-prov27-Dd1e165">
          <head xml:id="gom-prov27-Hd1e167">Versus 7</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-prov27-d1e169">
            <quote xml:id="gom-prov27-Qd1e171" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/prov27_7@1-4">Anima saturata calcabit favum,</quote>
            etc. <quote xml:id="gom-prov27-Qd1e174"><seg type="qs">Anima divitum</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">mortem ipsam pro Domino pati dulce habet.</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-prov27-Dd1e184">
          <head xml:id="gom-prov27-Hd1e186">Versus 8</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-prov27-d1e188">
            <quote xml:id="gom-prov27-Qd1e190" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/prov27_8@1-3">Sicut avis transmigrans.</quote>
            <quote xml:id="gom-prov27-Qd1e193"><seg type="qs">Sicut avis ova</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">ne a bono, quod faciebas, desistas.</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-prov27-Dd1e202">
          <head xml:id="gom-prov27-Hd1e204">Versus 10</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-prov27-d1e206">
            <pb ed="#P" n="1110C"/>
            <quote xml:id="gom-prov27-Qd1e210" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/prov27_10@19-21">Melior est vicinus.</quote>
            Melior est tibi, etc., <quote xml:id="gom-prov27-Qd1e213" source="http://scta.info/resource/sir40_3@5-10">usque ad, in Jericho, et incidit,</quote> etc
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-prov27-Dd1e218">
          <head xml:id="gom-prov27-Hd1e220">Versus 14</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-prov27-d1e222">
            <quote xml:id="gom-prov27-Qd1e224" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/prov27_14@1-3">Qui benedicit proximo,</quote>
            id est, qui favore superfluae laudis eum extollit, vel malis favendo, vel bona plus aequo laudando. Sed hic maledicenti assimilatur; quia vel in malo opere laudando confidentiam tribuit, vel in bono opere simplicitatem puri cordis minuit, ut quod superni amoris causa incoeperat, humano favore finiat.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-prov27-Dd1e229">
          <head xml:id="gom-prov27-Hd1e231">Versus 17</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-prov27-d1e233">
            <quote xml:id="gom-prov27-Qd1e235" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/prov27_17@1-2">Ferrum ferro.</quote>
            Bona consolatio consilium sapientum: qui dum se invicem consolando instruunt, ferrum ferro acuitur.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-prov27-Dd1e240">
          <head xml:id="gom-prov27-Hd1e242">Versus 20</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-prov27-d1e244">
            <quote xml:id="gom-prov27-Qd1e246" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/prov27_20@1-1">Infernus.</quote>
            <quote xml:id="gom-prov27-Qd1e249"><seg type="qs">Inferni tormenta non replentur</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">si naturam haberent sine <pb ed="#P" n="1110D"/> fine vivendi.</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-prov27-Dd1e260">
          <head xml:id="gom-prov27-Hd1e262">Versus 23</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-prov27-d1e264">
            <quote xml:id="gom-prov27-Qd1e266" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/prov27_23@1-1">Diligenter.</quote>
            <quote xml:id="gom-prov27-Qd1e269"><seg type="qs">Pastori Ecclesiae dicitur</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">si tuo tempore bene paveris.</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-prov27-Dd1e279">
          <head xml:id="gom-prov27-Hd1e281">Versus 25</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-prov27-d1e283">
            <quote xml:id="gom-prov27-Qd1e285" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/prov27_25@1-3">Aperta sunt prata.</quote>
            <quote xml:id="gom-prov27-Qd1e288"><seg type="qs">Aperta sunt modo pascua sacramentorum coelestium</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">ad spirituale subsidium data.</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-prov27-Dd1e297">
          <head xml:id="gom-prov27-Hd1e299">Versus 26</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-prov27-d1e301">
            <quote xml:id="gom-prov27-Qd1e303" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/prov27_26@1-3">Agni sunt ad vestimentum.</quote>
            Agnorum velleribus vestieris, dum bonis discipulorum obedientium moribus pastor ipse profeceris, eorumque laudabilia facta cernens, et in ornatu virtutum, et in calore dilectionis ipse gloriosus exstiteris. Haedis agrum comparas, dum peccatores ad poenitentiam vocando, sublimiorem tibi in terra viventium locum acquiris.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-prov27-Dd1e308">
          <head xml:id="gom-prov27-Hd1e310">Versus 27</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-prov27-d1e312">
            <pb ed="#P" n="1111A"/>
            <quote xml:id="gom-prov27-Qd1e316" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/prov27_27@1-4">Sufficiat tibi lac caprarum.</quote>
            <quote xml:id="gom-prov27-Qd1e319"><seg type="qs">Tanta instantia pecus commissum pasce</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">haedi pro pretio sanctorum, quibus nocuerant, ignibus tradentur.</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </body>
